der's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Q6BQcgabriKd5wPxvzOIWg","review_id":"845w5qB0lbO6I1TRqIWRPA","date":"2017-02-13T20:30:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9500706195831299,"text_excerpt":"I loved sucre, it's adorable and the shop from the outside as well as the inside is really pretty! It's like you stepped out in France all of a sudden because most of their dessert shops are like this. My kids went straight for the gelato and I got myself a box of macarons, they even had king cake inspired macaons for us to taste, so I had to get one. The flavors for the macarons are unique and NOLA flavors, at that. My husband got the white chocolate raspberry bar and it was really pretty and delicious at the same time! I got that with some coffee and sat in the shop, eating desserts with my family. If you have a sweet tooth or want to go to a dessert place after dinner, make sure to sto..."},{"business_id":"Q6BQcgabriKd5wPxvzOIWg","review_id":"W9TMN-V5sTZMz8gh_XUPlA","date":"2019-03-06T14:34:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9473811984062195,"text_excerpt":"YUM. Okay so for some reason I haven't been to this dessert spot in years?? Anyways I walked over here with a friend after bar hopping since they stay open late and I was having a sweets craving. They have so many types of desserts: macarons, fancy chocolates, cupcakes, and gelato. I tried an almond macaron, a cupcake, and the confetti cupcake & raspberry gelatos. All of them were amazing. The macaron and cupcake were moist and not dry at all. The gelatos were delish but I don't think anyone could go wrong there. The chocolate bark is also really high quality. The service was efficient and friendly. The prices here are higher than your standard dessert shop,but hey you're paying for appea..."},{"business_id":"Q6BQcgabriKd5wPxvzOIWg","review_id":"LXQ3dtXS-lJIGoQ1fRLBTw","date":"2018-08-02T12:56:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9365198612213135,"text_excerpt":"Literally obsessed with this place. I loved everything we had in this little dessert shop we stumbled upon. I didn't even know there were multiple locations. I tried the white chocolate lavender & it was amazing. The chocolate covered macarons have gold leaf on them so you know they gotta be good. They were, just fyi. Enough that on the way back to Atlanta, we came back so I could take some home. The giant macaron on a stick was maybe my favorite thing there. It was so decadent. Theyve got truffles & tons of pastries & everything is good. We sampled a little too much but it was vacation so who cares. You definitely have to try this place. Plus, there's a restaurant upstairs if you want di..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Q6BQcgabriKd5wPxvzOIWg","photo_id":"XGreutFwkrXO2X4skgoPUQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XGreutFwkrXO2X4skgoPUQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9250394105911255},{"business_id":"Q6BQcgabriKd5wPxvzOIWg","photo_id":"m4Ejt0atdfmAkLBKO_5K2A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/m4Ejt0atdfmAkLBKO_5K2A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8821372985839844},{"business_id":"Q6BQcgabriKd5wPxvzOIWg","photo_id":"2ay5sPS-JU1ucc_lBLMf-w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2ay5sPS-JU1ucc_lBLMf-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8704739809036255},{"business_id":"Q6BQcgabriKd5wPxvzOIWg","photo_id":"0ExkKDwDGUgotP32d-gIgA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0ExkKDwDGUgotP32d-gIgA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7858272790908813},{"business_id":"Q6BQcgabriKd5wPxvzOIWg","photo_id"